---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { BookOpen, Award, Landmark } from 'lucide-react';
import certImg from '../assets/cert.png';
import { CertificateViewer } from '../components/CertificateViewer';
---

<Layout title="About Us | The House of Rabbi Azanduna">
  <div class="py-8 sm:py-12 px-3.5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto bg-white font-['Poppins',sans-serif]">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 sm:mb-14">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0B1F3A]">About Us</span>
      <h1 class="font-['Barlow',sans-serif] text-3xl sm:text-6xl font-extrabold text-black uppercase tracking-tight mt-3 mb-3 sm:mb-4">
        The House of Rabbi Azanduna
      </h1>
      <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-[#0B1F3A] mx-auto mb-4 sm:mb-5"></div>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-xs sm:text-base font-normal leading-relaxed">
        A luxury Ghanaian perfume house dedicated to the art of sacred olfaction.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 lg:gap-14 items-center mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      <div class="aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-neutral-100 shadow-md">
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1616949755610-8c9bbc08f138?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80"
          alt="Artisanal perfume distillation"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0B1F3A]">Our House</span>
        <h2 class="font-['Barlow',sans-serif] text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-black uppercase">
          Sacred Olfaction
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-light">
          The House of Rabbi Azanduna is a luxury Ghanaian perfume house dedicated to the art of sacred olfaction. Rooted in rich heritage and meticulous craftsmanship, our house translates timeless biblical narrative, ancient wisdom, and theological depth into extraordinary fine fragrances.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-light">
          Founded by Rabbi Micah Felix Azanduna, our family-owned brand stands at the intersection of spiritual reverence and modern haute parfumerie. Operating from Ghana—a land long renowned for its precious raw materials, vibrant trade, and deep artistic traditions—we compose complex, evocative scents designed to evoke reverence, transformation, and inner clarity.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-light">
          Every creation is formulated as a living testament: a blend of rare natural botanicals, precious resins, and pure aromatics crafted to elevate the everyday wearing of scent into a deeply meaningful personal ritual.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 sm:mb-12">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0B1F3A]">Our Brand Philosophy</span>
      <h2 class="font-['Barlow',sans-serif] text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-black uppercase tracking-tight mt-3 mb-3">
        Sacred Wisdom, Bottled
      </h2>
      <div class="w-12 h-1 bg-[#0B1F3A] mx-auto"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 lg:gap-14 items-center mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      <div class="space-y-4 order-2 md:order-1">
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-light">
          We believe that fragrance is more than an aesthetic adornment—it is an invisible bridge between the sensory and the divine. From the frankincense and myrrh of ancient altars to the restorative balsams and exotic spices mentioned throughout sacred scripture, scent has always served as a vehicle for memory, prayer, and devotion.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-light">
          We draw directly from biblical doctrines, historical figures, and timeless philosophies to compose scents with soul and purpose.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-neutral-100 shadow-md order-1 md:order-2">
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1594035910387-fea47794261f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80"
          alt="Luxury perfume bottles"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-10 mb-12 sm:mb-16 shadow-xs">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0B1F3A]">Intentional Craft</span>
      <h2 class="font-['Barlow',sans-serif] text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-black uppercase tracking-tight mt-2 mb-2">
        The Artistry of Intentional Craft
      </h2>
      <div class="w-12 h-1 bg-[#0B1F3A] mb-4"></div>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-light max-w-3xl mb-6">
        As an independent, family-led house, we honor the deliberate patience of traditional perfumery. Our formulations are built with uncompromising attention to balance, structure, and depth.
      </p>
      <div class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-800">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#0B1F3A] mt-1.5 shrink-0"></span>
          <span><strong>Sacred Raw Materials:</strong> We source fine resins, woods, floral absolutes, and spices, pairing traditional biblical aromatics with high-grade modern accord design.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#0B1F3A] mt-1.5 shrink-0"></span>
          <span><strong>Maceration & Patience:</strong> Every batch undergoes a dedicated aging process, allowing raw materials to bind naturally into seamless, long-lasting compositions.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#0B1F3A] mt-1.5 shrink-0"></span>
          <span><strong>Artisanal Integrity:</strong> Being family-owned allows us total creative freedom, ensuring that every bottle leaving our atelier remains true to our vision and values.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0B1F3A]">Home & Anchor</span>
      <h2 class="font-['Barlow',sans-serif] text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-black uppercase tracking-tight mt-3 mb-4">
        A Ghanaian Legacy of Luxury
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-light">
        Ghana serves as both our home and our anchor. We take pride in representing African luxury on a global stage—demonstrating that world-class, intellectually grounded, and spiritually rich haute parfumerie thrives right here at home. We merge the warmth, dignity, and heritage of our Ghanaian roots with universal spiritual truths to create fragrances that resonate across borders.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-10 mb-12 sm:mb-16 shadow-xs">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="md:col-span-5 flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
          <CertificateViewer client:load imageSrc={certImg.src} />
        </div>

        <div class="md:col-span-7 space-y-4">
          <div>
            <h2 class="font-['Barlow',sans-serif] text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-black uppercase tracking-tight mb-2">
              A Certified & Trusted Fragrance House
            </h2>
            <div class="w-12 h-1 bg-[#0B1F3A] mb-4"></div>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-light">
            At The House of Rabbi Azanduna, authenticity and integrity guide everything we do. Operating as an officially registered company in Ghana is a reflection of our dedication to transparency, product safety, and customer satisfaction.
          </p>

          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-light">
            We know finding genuine, long-lasting fragrances can be challenging. That is why every perfume oil, artisanal attar, and aged Oud batch we formulate is crafted with uncompromised care, clean non-alcoholic ingredients, and strict attention to detail.
          </p>

          <div class="pt-2 space-y-2.5 text-xs text-gray-800">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#0B1F3A] mt-1.5 shrink-0"></span>
              <span><strong>100% Concentrated Pure Oils:</strong> Non-alcoholic, skin-friendly, and formulated for extraordinary 16+ hour longevity.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#0B1F3A] mt-1.5 shrink-0"></span>
              <span><strong>Ethically Sourced Ingredients:</strong> Genuine aged Oud resins, rare botanicals, and hand-selected floral distillates.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#0B1F3A] mt-1.5 shrink-0"></span>
              <span><strong>Verified Customer Confidence:</strong> Safe transactions, premium packaging, and reliable delivery across Ghana and beyond.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center mb-8">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0B1F3A]">Core Pillars</span>
      <h2 class="font-['Barlow',sans-serif] text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-black uppercase tracking-tight mt-3">
        What Guides the House
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 p-6 rounded-xl text-center">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#e7eef6] text-[#0B1F3A] flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
          <BookOpen size={24} />
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-['Barlow',sans-serif] text-lg font-bold text-black uppercase mb-1">
          Reverence
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 font-light">
          Honoring biblical heritage and the profound history of sacred aromatics.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 p-6 rounded-xl text-center">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#e7eef6] text-[#0B1F3A] flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
          <Award size={24} />
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-['Barlow',sans-serif] text-lg font-bold text-black uppercase mb-1">
          Excellence
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 font-light">
          Constructing rich, multi-layered formulas built to high-performance standards.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 p-6 rounded-xl text-center">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#e7eef6] text-[#0B1F3A] flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
          <Landmark size={24} />
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-['Barlow',sans-serif] text-lg font-bold text-black uppercase mb-1">
          Heritage
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 font-light">
          Remaining anchored as a proud Ghanaian family business driven by purpose and legacy.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center py-10 border-t border-gray-200">
      <h3 class="font-['Barlow',sans-serif] text-2xl font-bold text-black uppercase mb-3">
        Discover Your Signature Scent
      </h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mb-6">Explore our curated collections of fine fragrances and discovery sets.</p>
      <a
        href="/collections"
        class="inline-block px-8 py-3.5 bg-black hover:bg-[#0B1F3A] text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest rounded-lg transition-colors cursor-pointer"
      >
        Explore The Collections
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
